{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_019min_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_019min_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "2120947dd9955a90fe33ffe41becf34a62692ae87b85ef40c52316cdc0cdea33", "ja": "……ふふっ。", "zh": "……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_019min_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_019min_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "cf42d706047989ba9d7f85ae23bc02a84af2b639f694a4d237d8bebaf1e6ea76", "ja": "美奈子？　もうすぐ本番だけど……、\n意外と大丈夫そうだな？", "zh": "美奈子？马上就要正式演出了，不过……看起来意外地没问题啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_019min_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_019min_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "e6d8a19ab86c8efb0b89d55bda84b3f18998c79601295dd7194da9c1211906c1", "ja": "プロデューサーさん！　じつは、会場に来てる家族と\n友達から、メッセージがいっぱい届いてたんです。", "zh": "制作人！其实，来到会场的家人和朋友给我发来了好多消息。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_019min_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_019min_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "4ee57ce65536c099e320b58179619ebc45381357d51fc220f203ad473732081b", "ja": "『がんばれ～！』『応援してるよ！』って。\nなんていうか、よくある言葉なんですけど……。", "zh": "“加油～！”“支持你哦！”这样的。\n怎么说呢，虽然都是些常见的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_019min_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_019min_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "ad3f55ab562119fdbea17c5c0f400c2e5d600cdd9841695a77e5828de55dacc6", "ja": "これ、客席から打ってくれたんだって思ったら、\nステージに出るのが怖くなくなっちゃいました♪", "zh": "一想到这些话是从观众席发来的，我就不再害怕登上舞台了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_019min_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_019min_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "d31b66f95a4324c58e2f4bb71ff73cf25f2e297ca7284c609c4887d2d890730f", "ja": "……うん。きっと他のお客さんも、同じように\n応援してくれると思う。", "zh": "……嗯。我想其他观众也一定会同样\n为你加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_019min_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_019min_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "94f09d8c9a9d44376cf891fc4a610d479184caf71cc2d462d7537bf5b057a8ac", "ja": "ですよね！　私もそんな風に思えたんです！\n応援に応えるためにも、悔いを残さないように……。", "zh": "就是嘛！我也是这么想的！\n为了回应大家的支持，也为了不留下遗憾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_019min_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_019min_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "b16b2236ca4d0cd3775426aed59a6e315b0b6ce60b2782bf48be830dfadf60ab", "ja": "みんなで作り上げてきた、私たちのステージ。\nみんなで一緒に、全力で出し切ってきます！", "zh": "这是我们大家共同打造的舞台。\n我们会和大家一起，全力以赴地展现自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0296_story_019min_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0296_story_019min_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "799e9645fd33ae4767f1d8ece2c4c7bb929d76b197703fbe005dea92a77495fc", "ja": "ああ、今日一日しか楽しめない、初めてのステージだ。\nみんなと思いっきり、ぶつかってこい！", "zh": "啊，这是只有今天一天能尽情享受的、第一次登上的舞台。\n和大家尽情碰撞一番吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
